# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Lakeshire

step Lakeshire
  tip Cross the long bridge north into town: Dockmaster Baren on the docks, Bailiff Conacher in the town hall, Martie Jainrose in her garden at the west end. Marshal Marris and Foreman Oslow stand at the north end of the bridge: the Blackrock camps' quests and Alther's Mill are worked on this visit's loop east of the lake.
  accept 34 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Martie Jainrose
  accept 180 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- The Wanted poster by the inn
  tip Back east through town from Martie's garden: two Wanted posters hang on the town hall doorway.
  accept 95999 optional only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- The Wanted poster beside it
  vendor nearest optional
  accept 126 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Verner Osgood, by the road at the north end of the bridge
  accept 98386 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Foreman Oslow, beside him
  accept 20 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Marshal Marris, at the north end of the bridge
  accept 98387 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf

step Lakeshire
  when group 169
  accept 169 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- The Wanted poster on the town hall doorway

