# ---------------------------------------------------------------- East of the lake

step Alther's Mill
  zone Redridge Mountains
  tip Greater Tarantulas crawl on the slopes around Alther's Mill, north-east of the lake; their Tarantula Eggs lie on the ground among them: click six.
  kill 505 quest 98386.1 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Greater Tarantula
  interact 673101 quest 98386.2 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Tarantula Egg

step Blackrock camps
  tip South-east from the mill, west of Galardell Valley's gnolls, to the Blackrock camps east of Stonewatch Keep. Renegades, Grunts and Outrunners fill them; keep east of the keep, whose orcs are elite. Weapon racks and swords lie about the camps; meat haunches, grain sacks and water barrels hold the supplies.
  collect 3014 quest 20 @71,70.5 map 1433 live only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Battleworn Axe
  collect 280841 quest 98387 @68.3,79.4 map 1433 live only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Stolen Weapon: weapon racks and swords on the ground
  collect 280839 quest 98387 @67.4,78.9 map 1433 live only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Blackrock Supplies: meat haunches, grain sacks, water barrels

step Back to Lakeshire
  tip Into Lakeshire from the north with Keeshan: Bailiff Conacher and Magistrate Solomon in the town hall, Marshal Marris and Foreman Oslow at the north end of the bridge, then over the bridge to Guard Howe and the gryphons.
  turnin 98386 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Foreman Oslow
  turnin 20 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf
  turnin 98387 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf

step Incinerator Gar'im
  when group 95999
  when onquest 95999
  tip East past the mill, then south-east to the Blackrock camps east of Stonewatch Keep: Gar'im keeps to the cave at their south end with his imp and two orcs. Elite: group up if you can; solo, pull the orcs at the mouth first and interrupt his fire cast. He drops a Midnight Orb too.
  collect 271872 quest 95999 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Broken Staff of Incinerator Gar'im

step Galardell Valley
  zone Redridge Mountains
  tip North-east to the gnolls' eastern camp in Galardell Valley. Fangore has two guards linked to him: clear the gnolls around him first and fight at full health.
  collect 1075 quest 91 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Shadowhide Pendant: any Shadowhide gnoll
  collect 3632 quest 180 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Fangore's Paw

step A Watchful Eye
  tip The Old Lion Statue stands at the valley's east edge.
  turnin 94 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf
  accept 248 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf

step Looking Further
  tip West to the intact watch tower beside Stonewatch Keep: climb it and leave the Glyph in the empty jar at the top.
  turnin 248 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf

step Stonewatch Keep
  when group 169
  tip These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Gath'Ilzogg (level 26 elite) needs a group of 2. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back.
  collect 3633 quest 169 group 2 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Head of Gath'Ilzogg

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Render's Valley

step Redridge Canyons: kill these as you meet them
  zone Redridge Mountains
  tip From the keep head back west along the lake's north shore and north up the Redridge Canyons to Render's Valley; Lakeshire's hand-ins wait for Keeshan's escort, which ends there. Blackrock Champions camp in the valley.
  tip From the keep head back west along the lake's north shore and north up the Redridge Canyons. Just south of Render's Valley, Yowler, a level 25 gnoll, walks among the Redridge Alphas and Mystics.
  kill 435 quest 128 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Blackrock Champion, below ground
  collect 3614 quest 126 @22.7,21.6 map 1433 live only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Yowler's Paw

step Corporal Keeshan
  tip Keeshan hides at the very north end of the valley, by the Burning Steppes border. Escort him down to Lakeshire; Blackrock orcs ambush you on the way.
  accept 219 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf -- Corporal Keeshan, below ground
  complete 219 only Dwarf,Gnome,Human,NightElf

